                                "sense_id": "06bba56f-512f-3200-a742-642b3609e24a",
                                "text": "The Taoists even set up quotas of merits for the attainment of fairyhood, as stated in the Taoist scripture, Pao P'u Tzu […]"
                            },
                            {
