                                "sense_id": "06bba56f-512f-3200-a742-642b3609e24a",
                                "text": "It is important to note that the primitiveness of the notion of fairyhood does not allow the stipulation that a particular object is a fairy, any more than the primitiveness of the notion of point allows the stipulation that a particular object is a point."
                            }
